# Design MD

- Read `DESIGN.md` before adding or restyling UI.
- Use the documented tokens. Do not introduce one-off colors, radii, or fonts in feature code.
- Extend `DESIGN.md` in the same change when a new component or token is genuinely required.
- Pair every status color with a text label.
- Preserve visible keyboard focus, accessible names, and AA contrast.
- Provide empty, loading, and error states for any view that fetches data.
